# {{ challenge.name }}
{{ challenge.description }}

## Summary
- **Author**: {{ challenge.author }}
- **Category**: {{ challenge.category | capitalize }}
- **Difficulty**: {{ challenge.difficulty | capitalize }}
{% if challenge.extra_labels is not none %}
  {% for key, value in challenge.extra_labels.items() %}
- **{{ key | capitalize }}**: {{ value }}
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Hints
{% if challenge.hints is not none %}
  {% for hint in challenge.hints %}
- `{{ hint.content }}` ({{hint.cost}} points)
  {% endfor %}
{% else %}
None
{% endif %}

## Files
{% if challenge.files is not none %}
  {% for file in challenge.files %}
    {% if file.type == "static" %}
- [{{ file.path.name }}](<./{{ file.path.as_posix() }}>)
    {% elif file.type == "url" %}
- {{ file.url }}
    {% else %}
- {{ file }}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% else %}
None
{% endif %}

## Flags
{% if challenge.flags is not none %}
  {% for flag in challenge.flags %}
    {% if flag.type == "static" %}
- `{{ flag.value }}` (static, {% if flag.case_sensitive %}case-sensitive{% else %}case-insensitive{% endif %})
    {% elif flag.type == "regex" %}
- `{{ flag.pattern }}` (regex)
    {% else %}
- `{{ flag }}`
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% else %}
None
{% endif %}

## Services
{% if challenge.services is none %}
None
{% else %}
| Service | Ports | Type | Networks |
| ------- | ----- | ---- | -------- |
  {% for service in challenge.services %}
{{ "| [`" ~ service.name | truncate(30) ~ "`](<./" ~ service.path.as_posix() ~ ">)"
   ~ " | " ~ (service.ports | join(", ") if service.ports is not none else "None")
   ~ " | " ~ service.type | title
   ~ " | " ~ (service.networks | join(", ") if service.networks is not none else "None") ~ " |" }}
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Networks
{% if challenge.networks is none %}
None
{% else %}
| Network | Internal |
| ------- | -------- |
  {% for name, network in challenge.networks.items() %}
{{ "| `" ~ name | truncate(30) ~ "`"
   ~ " | " ~ ("Yes" if network.internal else "No") ~ " |" }}
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}